1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Video ya leo ni nini? Siku ya mwanafunzi wa kigeni.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sehemu ya 1: Kumbukumbu za Nyumbani na Mwanzo Mpya

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:16,808
Katika nchi yangu ya asili, theluji haishuki.

4
00:00:16,830 --> 00:00:21,864
Dimbwi la bahari ya buluu huonekana muda wote.

5
00:00:21,887 --> 00:00:27,387
Nilikulia katika mji wenye joto hilo.

6
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:31,797
Napenda kamera.

7
00:00:31,821 --> 00:00:36,581
Natamani kuona mandhari ambazo sijawahi kuona.

8
00:00:36,604 --> 00:00:41,512
Kwa hiyo, nilija chuo kikuu nchini Japani.

9
00:00:41,535 --> 00:00:47,369
Jina langu ni refu kidogo.

10
00:00:47,392 --> 00:00:54,225
Lakini, marafiki wangu wa Japani huniita kwa jina la utani fupi.

11
00:00:54,248 --> 00:00:58,948
Mimi ni mtu mwenye tabia ya kupendelea kucheka.

12
00:00:58,971 --> 00:01:04,205
Napenda mambo mapya na ya kufurahisha.

13
00:01:04,228 --> 00:01:09,461
Kila siku nchini Japani inang'aa kama almasi.

14
00:01:09,484 --> 00:01:13,519
Ee, habari za asubuhi.

15
00:01:13,543 --> 00:01:17,843
Ee, Sakura-san. Habari za asubuhi.

16
00:01:17,866 --> 00:01:21,141
Leo umefika mapema tena.

17
00:01:21,164 --> 00:01:25,998
Ndiyo. Napenda hewa ya asubuhi.

18
00:01:26,021 --> 00:01:29,961
Kamera yako ya leo inafaa sana.

19
00:01:29,985 --> 00:01:35,418
Ndiyo. Ni kitu changu cha thamani zaidi.

20
00:01:35,441 --> 00:01:39,479
Ulikuwa ukipiga picha nini asubuhi hii?

21
00:01:39,502 --> 00:01:44,661
Kando ya njia kulikuwa na ua dogo lililochanua.

22
00:01:44,685 --> 00:01:48,785
Si ua la mcherere, kweli?

23
00:01:48,808 --> 00:01:53,241
Ndiyo. Lilikuwa jeupe na dogo.

24
00:01:53,264 --> 00:01:56,531
Lilikuwa zuri sana.

25
00:01:56,554 --> 00:01:59,352
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

26
00:01:59,376 --> 00:02:02,242
Umepata picha nzuri?

27
00:02:02,265 --> 00:02:06,500
Ndiyo. Nitaonyesha baadaye.

28
00:02:06,524 --> 00:02:09,957
Nitasubiri kwa hamu.

29
00:02:09,980 --> 00:02:13,364
Umezoea maisha nchini Japani?

30
00:02:13,388 --> 00:02:17,769
Ndiyo, nimezoea kidogo.

31
00:02:17,793 --> 00:02:21,228
Chakula cha Japani ni vipi?

32
00:02:21,251 --> 00:02:25,084
Ni tamu sana.

33
00:02:25,107 --> 00:02:29,007
Napenda hasa ramen.

34
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:32,025
Ramen ni tamu, kweli.

35
00:02:32,049 --> 00:02:35,392
Umekwenda dukani gani?

36
00:02:35,416 --> 00:02:40,249
Ni duka mbele ya kituo cha treni lenye bango jeupe.

37
00:02:40,272 --> 00:02:44,039
Aa, pale.

38
00:02:44,062 --> 00:02:46,861
Pale ni maarufu sana.

39
00:02:46,884 --> 00:02:51,617
Ndiyo, kila wakati kuna foleni ya watu.

40
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:54,987
Kuna jambo lolote unalokabiliana nalo?

41
00:02:55,011 --> 00:03:01,244
Ee, kusoma kanji ni ngumu kidogo.

42
00:03:01,267 --> 00:03:04,236
Kanji ni ngumu, kweli.

43
00:03:04,259 --> 00:03:08,093
Hata Wajapani wanakabiliana na ugumu.

44
00:03:08,116 --> 00:03:10,273
Kweli?

45
00:03:10,297 --> 00:03:13,663
Nimejisikia polepole.

46
00:03:13,686 --> 00:03:19,153
Kama una swali lolote, wasiliana nami wakati wowote.

47
00:03:19,176 --> 00:03:21,363
Asante sana.

48
00:03:21,386 --> 00:03:24,653
Nafurahi sana.

49
00:03:24,676 --> 00:03:27,833
Unatumia kamusi?

50
00:03:27,856 --> 00:03:32,690
Ndiyo, ninatumia kamusi kwenye simu yangu.

51
00:03:32,713 --> 00:03:36,016
Ni rahisi sana, sivyo?

52
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:42,239
Ndiyo, lakini kuandika kwa mwenyewe ni vigumu.

53
00:03:42,262 --> 00:03:46,296
Kama utaandika kidogo kila siku, utakuwa sawa.

54
00:03:46,319 --> 00:03:49,630
Ndiyo, nitajitahidi.

55
00:03:49,654 --> 00:03:53,355
Daras la kwanza leo ni la nini?

56
00:03:53,378 --> 00:03:56,717
Ni historia ya Japani.

57
00:03:56,740 --> 00:04:00,640
Aa, nafanya darasa lilelile na wewe.

58
00:04:00,664 --> 00:04:03,018
Twende pamoja.

59
00:04:03,041 --> 00:04:06,308
Ndiyo, twende.

60
00:04:06,331 --> 00:04:10,464
Unaelewa unaposikia mwalimu anazungumza kwa kasi?

61
00:04:10,487 --> 00:04:14,228
Kwa nyakati huwa sielewi.

62
00:04:14,251 --> 00:04:17,718
Nitakupa daftari langu, basi usisite kutaka.

63
00:04:17,741 --> 00:04:22,008
Sakura, wewe huwa mpole sana.

64
00:04:22,031 --> 00:04:27,387
Nikizungumza nawe, moyo wangu hupata joto.

65
00:04:27,410 --> 00:04:33,344
Maisha ya chuo kikuu nchini Japani ni ya furaha sana.

66
00:04:33,367 --> 00:04:42,376
Programu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kutoka maelezo na maoni ya kwanza. Tafadhali achia maoni kabla ya kupakua.

67
00:04:42,376 --> 00:04:43,876
Sehemu ya 2: Maktaba na Historia

68
00:04:43,876 --> 00:04:47,451
Daras limekwisha.

69
00:04:47,474 --> 00:04:51,974
Maktaba ya chuo kikuu ni kubwa sana.

70
00:04:51,997 --> 00:04:57,230
Kuna vitabu vingi zaidi kuliko maktaba nchini kwangu.

71
00:04:57,254 --> 00:05:01,155
Ina harufu ya karatasi za zamani.

72
00:05:01,178 --> 00:05:06,169
Napenda mahali pa kimya hiki.

73
00:05:06,193 --> 00:05:09,693
Napenda historia.

74
00:05:09,716 --> 00:05:16,849
Watu wa kale walicheka na kulia kama sisi.

75
00:05:16,873 --> 00:05:21,668
Hiyo inanifanya nisemeze hisia za ajabu.

76
00:05:21,692 --> 00:05:24,825
Umechoka?

77
00:05:24,848 --> 00:05:29,205
Aa, Sakura. Umechoka?

78
00:05:29,229 --> 00:05:33,411
Daras la historia ya Japani lilikuwa vipi?

79
00:05:33,434 --> 00:05:36,734
Lilikuwa la kushangaza sana.

80
00:05:36,757 --> 00:05:39,303
Kweli?

81
00:05:39,327 --> 00:05:42,110
Halikuwa vigumu?

82
00:05:42,133 --> 00:05:45,927
Ilikuwa vigumu kidogo.

83
00:05:45,951 --> 00:05:50,148
Lakini mazungumzo ya mwalimu ni ya furaha.

84
00:05:50,171 --> 00:05:54,938
Una nia na majengo ya kihistoria ya Japani kama hekalu na mahekalu?

85
00:05:54,962 --> 00:05:59,729
Ndiyo, napenda picha za mahekalu na hekalu.

86
00:05:59,752 --> 00:06:03,985
Siku hizi, nenda Kyoto ukaone.

87
00:06:04,008 --> 00:06:06,792
Kyoto?

88
00:06:06,816 --> 00:06:09,386
Iko mbali?

89
00:06:09,410 --> 00:06:13,795
Gari la moshi la Shinkansen litachukua muda kidogo.

90
00:06:13,819 --> 00:06:19,085
Ndiyo hiyo. Siku moja nitapenda kwenda.

91
00:06:19,108 --> 00:06:22,742
Kuna majengo ya kihistoria mengi.

92
00:06:22,765 --> 00:06:26,317
Nitapenda kuchukua picha nyingi.

93
00:06:26,340 --> 00:06:29,640
Ua za mahekalu pia ni nzuri.

94
00:06:29,663 --> 00:06:34,644
Miti na mawe katika bustani za Japani ni ya kuvutia.

95
00:06:34,668 --> 00:06:39,801
Ndiyo, mandhari hubadilika kulingana na msimu.

96
00:06:39,824 --> 00:06:42,539
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

97
00:06:42,563 --> 00:06:47,030
Bado kuna muda hadi darasa linayofuata.

98
00:06:47,053 --> 00:06:51,286
Ndiyo, nitasoma kitabu kidogo.

99
00:06:51,309 --> 00:06:54,176
Unasoma kitabu gani?

100
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:57,268
Ni manga ya Japani.

101
00:06:57,291 --> 00:07:00,444
Utakua unafanya mazoezi ya kanji.

102
00:07:00,467 --> 00:07:04,567
Eeh, unasoma kwa kutumia manga?

103
00:07:04,590 --> 00:07:08,747
Ndiyo, maneno yake ni ya kawaida na nzuri.

104
00:07:08,771 --> 00:07:12,346
Ndiyo hivo. Una bidii sana.

105
00:07:12,370 --> 00:07:16,703
Hapana, napenda tu manga.

106
00:07:16,726 --> 00:07:19,859
Una manga yoyote unayopendekeza?

107
00:07:19,882 --> 00:07:24,027
Manga hii ya michezo ni nzuri sana.

108
00:07:24,050 --> 00:07:27,398
Nitaijaribu kusoma pia.

109
00:07:27,422 --> 00:07:31,555
Tafadhali soma. Nitaikopesha.

110
00:07:31,578 --> 00:07:34,330
Naweza kuipewa kwa mkopo?

111
00:07:34,354 --> 00:07:36,496
Asante.

112
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:42,352
Napenda kushiriki vitu ninavyovipenda na marafiki.

113
00:07:42,375 --> 00:07:46,875
Nataka kuzungumza zaidi kuhusu manga za Kijapani.

114
00:07:46,898 --> 00:07:54,003
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na ukaguzi wa juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

115
00:07:54,003 --> 00:07:55,503
Sehemu ya 3: Furaha ya Chakula cha Chuo Kikuu / Furaha za Mgahawa wa Chuo Kikuu

116
00:07:55,503 --> 00:07:58,936
Ni wakati wa chakula cha mchana.

117
00:07:58,959 --> 00:08:03,899
Kuna harufu tamu inayotoka kwenye mgahawa.

118
00:08:03,923 --> 00:08:07,023
Nina njaa.

119
00:08:07,046 --> 00:08:12,683
Nchini kwangu hatuna mgahawa mkubwa kama huu.

120
00:08:12,707 --> 00:08:17,065
Sisi huwa tunakula chakula cha mfuko pamoja.

121
00:08:17,089 --> 00:08:22,555
Mgahawa wa vyuo vikuu vya Japani una chaguo nyingi za chakula.

122
00:08:22,578 --> 00:08:27,212
Kila siku ninakula chakula tofauti.

123
00:08:27,235 --> 00:08:32,225
Hiyo ni moja ya furaha zangu.

124
00:08:32,248 --> 00:08:36,764
Sawa kwamba kuna nafasi ya kuketi.

125
00:08:36,787 --> 00:08:40,968
Ndiyo. Kuna watu wengi sana.

126
00:08:40,992 --> 00:08:44,259
Leo utakula nini?

127
00:08:44,282 --> 00:08:48,670
Nimeamua kula pilau ya kare.

128
00:08:48,693 --> 00:08:52,593
Unapenda pilau ya kare?

129
00:08:52,616 --> 00:08:56,950
Ndiyo, napenda sana.

130
00:08:56,972 --> 00:09:00,641
Nchini kwangu kuna kare pia.

131
00:09:00,664 --> 00:09:04,931
Lakini ladha yake ni tofauti kidogo.

132
00:09:04,954 --> 00:09:08,721
Kare ya Japani ni tamu?

133
00:09:08,744 --> 00:09:14,293
Ndiyo, tamu na nzito.

134
00:09:14,316 --> 00:09:18,227
Mimi leo nimeamua kula udon.

135
00:09:18,251 --> 00:09:21,394
Udon pia ni tamu sana.

136
00:09:21,418 --> 00:09:26,084
Ndiyo, ninapenda kwa sababu ni moto.

137
00:09:26,107 --> 00:09:28,741
Tunakula.

138
00:09:28,764 --> 00:09:31,397
Tunakula.

139
00:09:31,420 --> 00:09:35,391
Kare ni tamu sana.

140
00:09:35,414 --> 00:09:38,081
Vizuri.

141
00:09:38,104 --> 00:09:40,274
Si kali sana?

142
00:09:40,297 --> 00:09:43,397
Sio tatizo.

143
00:09:43,420 --> 00:09:47,321
Mimi napenda vyakula vyenye pilipili.

144
00:09:47,345 --> 00:09:50,294
Ndiyo, hivyo ndivyo.

145
00:09:50,318 --> 00:09:54,493
Kuna chakula chochote cha Japani usichokipenda?

146
00:09:54,516 --> 00:09:59,016
Hmm, bado sijakuta.

147
00:09:59,039 --> 00:10:01,339
Kweli?

148
00:10:01,362 --> 00:10:04,736
Unaweza kula natto?

149
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:10,893
Natto? Bado sijala.

150
00:10:10,916 --> 00:10:14,018
Jaribu siku moja.

151
00:10:14,041 --> 00:10:16,575
Ni tamu.

152
00:10:16,598 --> 00:10:20,572
Sawa. Nitaijaribu.

153
00:10:20,595 --> 00:10:25,383
Kwenye menyu ya mgahawa, chakula unachokipenda zaidi ni kipi?

154
00:10:25,407 --> 00:10:29,242
Ninapenda karai na kuku wa kung'oa.

155
00:10:29,266 --> 00:10:32,983
Kuku wa kung'oa ni tamu sana, hata mimi napenda.

156
00:10:33,007 --> 00:10:37,273
Ndiyo. Nyama yake ni laini sana.

157
00:10:37,296 --> 00:10:43,030
Aa, wiki ijayo nitakuwa na likizo ya chuo kikuu.

158
00:10:43,053 --> 00:10:46,619
Eeh, kweli?

159
00:10:46,642 --> 00:10:52,609
Ndiyo, Alhamisi na Ijumaa tutakuwa likizo.

160
00:10:52,632 --> 00:10:55,709
Likizo ya siku nne mfululizo!

161
00:10:55,732 --> 00:10:59,166
Nafurahi sana.

162
00:10:59,189 --> 00:11:04,928
Napenda wakati ninapokula chakula kitamu na moto.

163
00:11:04,951 --> 00:11:09,851
Ninapenda kula pamoja na marafiki na kucheka.

164
00:11:09,874 --> 00:11:15,407
Kila siku yangu ina furaha nyingi.

165
00:11:15,430 --> 00:11:16,930
Sehemu ya 4: Matembezi Jijini Siku ya Jumapili

166
00:11:16,930 --> 00:11:20,863
Leo ni Jumapili.

167
00:11:20,886 --> 00:11:26,820
Ninatembea mjini peke yangu.

168
00:11:26,843 --> 00:11:32,509
Mji wa Japani siku za likizo una watu wengi.

169
00:11:32,532 --> 00:11:36,599
Kuna majengo makubwa mengi.

170
00:11:36,622 --> 00:11:41,922
Majengo hapa ni marefu zaidi kuliko nchini kwangu.

171
00:11:41,945 --> 00:11:49,012
Lakini baada ya kutembea kidogo, kuna bustani ndogo pia.

172
00:11:49,035 --> 00:11:52,309
Kuna maduka ya zamani pia.

173
00:11:52,332 --> 00:11:57,091
Mji huu ni furaha kutembea.

174
00:11:57,115 --> 00:12:00,081
Aa, hiyo.

175
00:12:00,104 --> 00:12:02,338
Eeh?

176
00:12:02,361 --> 00:12:07,094
Nahisi tu. Ni bahati tu.

177
00:12:07,117 --> 00:12:10,755
Bibi Sakura, habari.

178
00:12:10,778 --> 00:12:13,296
Habari.

179
00:12:13,319 --> 00:12:15,898
Unatembea peke yako?

180
00:12:15,922 --> 00:12:18,355
Ndiyo.

181
00:12:18,378 --> 00:12:22,245
Nilikuwa ninapiga picha wakati ninatembea.

182
00:12:22,268 --> 00:12:26,444
Umepata picha nzuri?

183
00:12:26,467 --> 00:12:28,734
Ndiyo.

184
00:12:28,757 --> 00:12:32,324
Nimepiga picha ya treni ya barabarani.

185
00:12:32,347 --> 00:12:36,453
Treni hizi za hapa ni nzuri sana.

186
00:12:36,476 --> 00:12:38,669
Ndiyo.

187
00:12:38,693 --> 00:12:42,681
Nchini kwangu hatuna treni kama hizi.

188
00:12:42,704 --> 00:12:46,438
Zinaenda polepole sana.

189
00:12:46,461 --> 00:12:48,598
Ndiyo.

190
00:12:48,621 --> 00:12:52,290
Mandhari kutoka dirishani ni nzuri pia.

191
00:12:52,314 --> 00:12:56,547
Bibi Sakura, ulikuwa unafanya nini?

192
00:12:56,570 --> 00:13:00,603
Nilikuwa ninunua vitu.

193
00:13:00,626 --> 00:13:02,726
Nguo?

194
00:13:02,749 --> 00:13:05,016
Ndiyo.

195
00:13:05,039 --> 00:13:08,512
Nimenunua shati mpya.

196
00:13:08,536 --> 00:13:11,121
Nzuri sana.

197
00:13:11,145 --> 00:13:13,851
Ni rangi gani?

198
00:13:13,874 --> 00:13:18,508
Rangi ya mvua ya machipuko.

199
00:13:18,531 --> 00:13:21,631
Hakika itakufaa.

200
00:13:21,654 --> 00:13:26,363
Nilifikiria kwenda kafeni kunywa chai.

201
00:13:26,386 --> 00:13:28,853
Kafeni?

202
00:13:28,876 --> 00:13:31,749
Je, ungependa kuja pamoja?

203
00:13:31,772 --> 00:13:33,942
Ndiyo.

204
00:13:33,965 --> 00:13:36,798
Ningependa sana.

205
00:13:36,821 --> 00:13:41,768
Kuna duka la keki tamu karibu hapa.

206
00:13:41,792 --> 00:13:46,164
Napenda sana vitu vyenye sukari.

207
00:13:46,187 --> 00:13:49,621
Basi, twende huko.

208
00:13:49,644 --> 00:13:52,824
Je, ni mbali kidogo?

209
00:13:52,847 --> 00:13:57,246
Kutoka hapa ni dakika tano kwa miguu.

210
00:13:57,270 --> 00:13:59,938
Nimeelewa.

211
00:13:59,961 --> 00:14:05,028
Keki za Japani ni nzuri na tamu sana.

212
00:14:05,051 --> 00:14:07,009
Ndiyo.

213
00:14:07,032 --> 00:14:09,535
Ninangojelea sana.

214
00:14:09,558 --> 00:14:14,260
Kutana na rafiki kwa bahati mbaya ni furaha kubwa.

215
00:14:14,284 --> 00:14:22,617
Kutembea mjini peke yangu ni furaha, lakini kutembea na mtu mwingine ni bora zaidi.

216
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:27,198
Leo inaonekana kuwa likizo nzuri.

217
00:14:27,221 --> 00:14:28,721
Sehemu ya 5: Jaribio la Kwanza la Tennis

218
00:14:28,721 --> 00:14:34,467
Nimejiunga na klabu ya tennis ya chuo kikuu.

219
00:14:34,491 --> 00:14:39,524
Nchini kwangu, nilicheza soka mara kwa mara.

220
00:14:39,547 --> 00:14:42,781
Tennis ni mara yangu ya kwanza.

221
00:14:42,804 --> 00:14:47,989
Lakini, nilitaka kujaribu mchezo mpya.

222
00:14:48,012 --> 00:14:52,545
Kukimbia kwenye uwanja kunanitosha vizuri.

223
00:14:52,568 --> 00:14:56,635
Napenda sauti ya kugonga mpira.

224
00:14:56,658 --> 00:15:01,043
Ninataka kuwa mzuri, kwa hiyo nitak gyakor mashika mengi.

225
00:15:01,067 --> 00:15:03,972
Umechoka?

226
00:15:03,996 --> 00:15:07,177
Umechoka sana leo.

227
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:10,700
Mazoezi ya leo yalikuwa vipi?

228
00:15:10,723 --> 00:15:14,037
Nilichoka sana.

229
00:15:14,061 --> 00:15:17,166
Lakini, ni furaha.

230
00:15:17,190 --> 00:15:20,726
Umekuwa mzuri sana.

231
00:15:20,749 --> 00:15:23,383
Kweli?

232
00:15:23,406 --> 00:15:26,139
Nafurahi sana.

233
00:15:26,162 --> 00:15:28,395
Ndiyo.

234
00:15:28,418 --> 00:15:32,593
Mwanzo haukuweza kumpiga mpira hata kidogo.

235
00:15:32,617 --> 00:15:35,013
Ndiyo.

236
00:15:35,036 --> 00:15:39,178
Kwa sababu Sakura alinitumia vizuri.

237
00:15:39,202 --> 00:15:43,335
Kwa sababu unafanya mazoezi kila siku.

238
00:15:43,358 --> 00:15:47,728
Tennis ni mchezo mzuri sana.

239
00:15:47,752 --> 00:15:50,586
Ndiyo.

240
00:15:50,609 --> 00:15:53,447
Ungependa kushiriki katika mechi?

241
00:15:53,470 --> 00:15:55,636
Ndiyo.

242
00:15:55,659 --> 00:15:59,759
Ningependa kushiriki katika mechi siku moja.

243
00:15:59,782 --> 00:16:04,416
Mwezi ujao, kuna mechi ndogo ya klabu.

244
00:16:04,439 --> 00:16:07,172
Kweli?

245
00:16:07,195 --> 00:16:10,666
Je, naweza kushiriki?

246
00:16:10,690 --> 00:16:13,487
Ndiyo, bila shaka.

247
00:16:13,510 --> 00:16:16,288
Tutashiriki pamoja?

248
00:16:16,312 --> 00:16:18,612
Eeh?

249
00:16:18,635 --> 00:16:21,623
Je, ni pamoja na Sakura kama mshirika?

250
00:16:21,647 --> 00:16:24,001
Ndiyo.

251
00:16:24,024 --> 00:16:28,491
Mimi mbele, wewe nyuma.

252
00:16:28,514 --> 00:16:30,086
Unafikirije?

253
00:16:30,109 --> 00:16:34,306
Labda nitafanya vibaya.

254
00:16:34,330 --> 00:16:37,266
Hakuna matata.

255
00:16:37,289 --> 00:16:40,390
Kufurahia ndio muhimu zaidi.

256
00:16:40,413 --> 00:16:43,280
Sawa.

257
00:16:43,303 --> 00:16:46,012
Tafadhali nisaidie.

258
00:16:46,035 --> 00:16:51,069
Basi, tutafanya mazoezi zaidi kuanzia wiki ijayo.

259
00:16:51,092 --> 00:16:53,158
Ndiyo.

260
00:16:53,181 --> 00:16:55,548
Nitapiga kwa nguvu.

261
00:16:55,571 --> 00:16:59,806
Labda tunahitaji mazoezi zaidi ya kukimbia?

262
00:16:59,829 --> 00:17:02,306
Ndiyo.

263
00:17:02,330 --> 00:17:05,469
Nitapata nguvu zaidi.

264
00:17:05,493 --> 00:17:09,660
Juisi baada ya mazoezi ni tamu sana.

265
00:17:09,683 --> 00:17:12,149
Ndiyo.

266
00:17:12,172 --> 00:17:15,239
Ni baridi na tamu.

267
00:17:15,262 --> 00:17:19,739
Nimechawisha jasho nyingi.

268
00:17:19,762 --> 00:17:24,077
Jihadhari usijeukimwa na mafua.

269
00:17:24,101 --> 00:17:26,067
Ndiyo.

270
00:17:26,090 --> 00:17:28,524
Asante sana.

271
00:17:28,547 --> 00:17:33,647
Napenda sana marafiki wa chama changu.

272
00:17:33,670 --> 00:17:37,570
Tunatoa jasho pamoja na wenzangu.

273
00:17:37,593 --> 00:17:43,093
Hii itakuwa kumbukumbu nzuri zaidi ya maisha yangu ya chuo kikuu nchini Japani.

274
00:17:43,116 --> 00:17:44,616
Sehemu ya 6: Kazi ya Nje ya Huduma kwa Wateja Nchini Japani

275
00:17:44,616 --> 00:17:51,362
Nimeanza kazi ya nje katika kafe karibu na kituo cha treni.

276
00:17:51,385 --> 00:17:57,505
Katika nchi yangu, sijawahi kufanya kazi ya nje.

277
00:17:57,529 --> 00:18:02,408
Huduma kwa wateja nchini Japani ni ya hali ya juu sana.

278
00:18:02,431 --> 00:18:08,664
Mwanzoni nilijihisi aibu kusema 'irasshaimase'.

279
00:18:08,687 --> 00:18:13,441
Lakini sasa naweza kusema kwa sauti kubwa.

280
00:18:13,465 --> 00:18:18,244
Kupata tabasamu za wateja kunanipa furaha.

281
00:18:18,268 --> 00:18:22,334
Umechoka. Umeshaisha shift?

282
00:18:22,357 --> 00:18:26,595
Ndiyo. Nimekwisha sasa hivi.

283
00:18:26,619 --> 00:18:30,408
Leo ulikuwa na shughuli nyingi sana, sivyo?

284
00:18:30,431 --> 00:18:35,229
Ndiyo. Wateja wengi walikuja.

285
00:18:35,253 --> 00:18:38,386
Hukuwa na makosa katika maagizo?

286
00:18:38,409 --> 00:18:42,709
Hapana. Hakukuwa na hata moja.

287
00:18:42,732 --> 00:18:47,723
Unafanya vizuri. Umeshazoea kabisa.

288
00:18:47,747 --> 00:18:50,980
Ni kwa sababu ya msaada wa Senpai Sakura.

289
00:18:51,003 --> 00:18:54,720
Hapa si lazima uniseme Senpai.

290
00:18:54,744 --> 00:18:59,044
Hapana, wakati wa kazi ni Senpai.

291
00:18:59,067 --> 00:19:01,700
Una bidii sana.

292
00:19:01,723 --> 00:19:05,228
Umejifunza Kiswahili vizuri pia.

293
00:19:05,251 --> 00:19:09,998
Nimejifunza maneno yote ya menyu.

294
00:19:10,022 --> 00:19:12,455
Inauma sana.

295
00:19:12,478 --> 00:19:15,978
Je, unaweza kuzungumza na wateja sasa?

296
00:19:16,001 --> 00:19:21,468
Ndiyo. Naongea kidogo kuhusu hali ya hewa na mambo kama hayo.

297
00:19:21,491 --> 00:19:25,924
Nzuri. Wateja watapendezwa.

298
00:19:25,947 --> 00:19:30,286
Napenda kujifunza kutengeneza kahawa vizuri pia.

299
00:19:30,310 --> 00:19:33,810
Siku moja nitakufundisha.

300
00:19:33,833 --> 00:19:36,104
Kweli?

301
00:19:36,128 --> 00:19:38,901
Tafadhali nisaidie.

302
00:19:38,924 --> 00:19:42,296
Kazi ya nje nchini Japani inakuwaje?

303
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:47,221
Kuna mengi ya kujifunza, lakini ni ya furaha.

304
00:19:47,244 --> 00:19:51,399
Haya, basi ni vizuri.

305
00:19:51,422 --> 00:19:55,889
Kupokea pesa zako mwenyewe kunanipa furaha.

306
00:19:55,912 --> 00:19:59,179
Unanunua nini na pesa za kazi ya nje?

307
00:19:59,202 --> 00:20:03,548
Nataka kununua lensi mpya ya kamera.

308
00:20:03,571 --> 00:20:06,968
Je, utafanya kazi ya nje kesho?

309
00:20:06,991 --> 00:20:11,100
Hapana, kesho nitapumzika.

310
00:20:11,124 --> 00:20:14,243
Pumzika polepole.

311
00:20:14,266 --> 00:20:16,862
Asante sana.

312
00:20:16,886 --> 00:20:20,635
Sasa, rudi nyumbani salama.

313
00:20:20,659 --> 00:20:26,492
Upepo wa usiku baada ya kazi ni mnene sana.

314
00:20:26,515 --> 00:20:30,882
Ninapata pesa kwa kufanya kazi mwenyewe.

315
00:20:30,905 --> 00:20:35,055
Ninahisi kama nimekuwa mtu mzima kidogo.

316
00:20:35,078 --> 00:20:36,578
Sehemu ya 7: Maandalizi ya Hotuba ya Mwanafunzi wa Kimataifa

317
00:20:36,578 --> 00:20:42,489
Jumamosi ijayo, kutakuwa na mashindano ya hotuba kwa wanafunzi wa kimataifa.

318
00:20:42,513 --> 00:20:47,146
Nimechaguliwa kuwa mwakilishi.

319
00:20:47,169 --> 00:20:50,403
Nina wasiwasi sana.

320
00:20:50,426 --> 00:20:55,170
Mada ni kuhusu nchi yangu na Japani.

321
00:20:55,193 --> 00:20:58,827
Nina mambo mengi ninayotaka kusema.

322
00:20:58,850 --> 00:21:04,724
Lakini ni vigumu kunena kwa Kijapani kwa muda mrefu.

323
00:21:04,747 --> 00:21:09,814
Kila usiku, nafanya mazoezi mbele ya kioo chumbani.

324
00:21:09,837 --> 00:21:13,614
Tayari umeandika hotuba?

325
00:21:13,638 --> 00:21:17,704
Ndiyo, nimeandika kwa kadri yangu.

326
00:21:17,727 --> 00:21:20,261
Onyesha kidogo.

327
00:21:20,284 --> 00:21:23,517
Nitakagua kwa ajili yako.

328
00:21:23,540 --> 00:21:26,173
Tafadhali.

329
00:21:26,196 --> 00:21:31,371
Eeh, maudhui yako ni mazuri sana.

330
00:21:31,395 --> 00:21:33,562
Kweli?

331
00:21:33,585 --> 00:21:37,357
Kuna Kijapani isiyofaa?

332
00:21:37,380 --> 00:21:42,254
Hapa, maneno yako yanaonekana kidogo yasiyo kawaida.

333
00:21:42,277 --> 00:21:45,577
Nitairekebisha vipi?

334
00:21:45,600 --> 00:21:50,135
Maneno haya yanaonekana zaidi ya kawaida.

335
00:21:50,158 --> 00:21:53,757
Sawa, nimeelewa.

336
00:21:53,780 --> 00:21:59,016
Umevutiwa sana na utamaduni wa Japani, sivyo?

337
00:21:59,040 --> 00:22:04,307
Ndiyo. Kwa sababu utamaduni kama huo hapana nchini kwangu.

338
00:22:04,330 --> 00:22:08,271
Umevutiwa hasa na nini?

339
00:22:08,294 --> 00:22:12,250
Ni jinsi watu wanavyofuata sheria.

340
00:22:12,273 --> 00:22:16,407
Aa, kama kupanga mstari kwa treni.

341
00:22:16,430 --> 00:22:21,263
Ndiyo. Wanaopanga kwa utaratibu sana.

342
00:22:21,286 --> 00:22:25,953
Hii itawafanya watu wote wavutiwe.

343
00:22:25,976 --> 00:22:28,809
Sasa nina imani.

344
00:22:28,832 --> 00:22:31,265
Asante sana.

345
00:22:31,288 --> 00:22:36,226
Sasa unahitaji tu kusema kwa sauti kubwa.

346
00:22:36,250 --> 00:22:41,117
Ndiyo, nataka pia kufanya mazoezi ya matamshi.

347
00:22:41,139 --> 00:22:45,373
Basi, tutafanya mazoezi kidogo sasa hivi?

348
00:22:45,396 --> 00:22:48,096
Sasa hivi?

349
00:22:48,119 --> 00:22:51,152
Nashindwa kidogo.

350
00:22:51,175 --> 00:22:55,119
Hakuna mtu, utakuwa sawa.

351
00:22:55,143 --> 00:22:57,247
Sawa.

352
00:22:57,271 --> 00:22:59,771
Nitaisoma.

353
00:22:59,794 --> 00:23:03,367
Sawa. Soma polepole.

354
00:23:03,390 --> 00:23:06,857
Habari zenu, watu wote.

355
00:23:06,880 --> 00:23:10,470
Mimi ni...

356
00:23:10,493 --> 00:23:14,200
Eeh, ukubwa wa sauti ule ni mzuri.

357
00:23:14,224 --> 00:23:17,524
Nitaendelea na hali hii.

358
00:23:17,547 --> 00:23:20,780
Nitakuja kuona wakati wa maonyesho pia.

359
00:23:20,803 --> 00:23:26,348
Kwa kuwa nafikiri marafiki wangu watasikiliza, nina nguvu zaidi.

360
00:23:26,371 --> 00:23:32,210
Nitawasilisha hisia zangu kwa maneno yangu.

361
00:23:32,233 --> 00:23:35,333
Nitapiga debe kwa bidii.

362
00:23:35,356 --> 00:23:36,856
Mstari wa 8: Masomo ya Mtihani wa Mwisho

363
00:23:36,856 --> 00:23:41,627
Wiki ijayo ni mtihani wa mwisho.

364
00:23:41,651 --> 00:23:46,884
Mitihani ya vyuo vikuu vya Japani ni ngumu.

365
00:23:46,907 --> 00:23:52,607
Mimi husoma kila siku maktabani.

366
00:23:52,630 --> 00:23:58,497
Mandhari nje ya dirisha imekuwa baridi kabisa.

367
00:23:58,520 --> 00:24:03,156
Nchini kwangu hakuna baridi.

368
00:24:03,180 --> 00:24:08,880
Kwa hivyo, upepo wa baridi ni mgumu kidogo kwangu.

369
00:24:08,903 --> 00:24:14,736
Lakini, anga ya nyota ya baridi ni nzuri sana, nafikiri.

370
00:24:14,759 --> 00:24:18,115
Masomo yanaendelea?

371
00:24:18,138 --> 00:24:21,471
Aa, Sakura.

372
00:24:21,494 --> 00:24:25,561
Hapana, sijaendelea kabisa.

373
00:24:25,584 --> 00:24:29,117
Unasoma nini?

374
00:24:29,140 --> 00:24:32,681
Ninasoma kwa ajili ya mtihani wa uchumi.

375
00:24:32,704 --> 00:24:35,684
Uchumi, eh?

376
00:24:35,708 --> 00:24:39,741
Maneno ya kitaalam ni magumu, sivyo?

377
00:24:39,764 --> 00:24:43,834
Ndiyo. Sijui kusoma kanji.

378
00:24:43,858 --> 00:24:47,098
Sehemu gani usiyoiielewa?

379
00:24:47,121 --> 00:24:49,754
Nitakueleza.

380
00:24:49,777 --> 00:24:53,744
Sifahamu maana ya grafu hii.

381
00:24:53,767 --> 00:24:59,045
Aa, hii hapa. Namba zinaongezeka, sivyo?

382
00:24:59,068 --> 00:25:03,181
Ndiyo, zinaongezeka kwa kasi.

383
00:25:03,205 --> 00:25:08,471
Hivyo maana yake bei inapanda.

384
00:25:08,494 --> 00:25:12,794
Ahaa, ndivyo ilivyo!

385
00:25:12,817 --> 00:25:16,117
Eeh, rahisi, sivyo?

386
00:25:16,140 --> 00:25:20,573
Sakura anaposoma, kila kitu kinaeleweka upesi.

387
00:25:20,596 --> 00:25:25,375
Vizuri. Kuna sehemu nyingine usiyoiielewa?

388
00:25:25,399 --> 00:25:28,699
Sasa niko sawa.

389
00:25:28,722 --> 00:25:31,789
Unasoma usiku kucha?

390
00:25:31,812 --> 00:25:37,112
Ndiyo, jana nilisoma mpaka saa tisa usiku.

391
00:25:37,135 --> 00:25:40,640
Usijitahidi mno.

392
00:25:40,663 --> 00:25:43,163
Sio tatizo.

393
00:25:43,186 --> 00:25:45,985
Nina umri, niko poa.

394
00:25:46,008 --> 00:25:49,761
Utaumia afya yako.

395
00:25:49,785 --> 00:25:52,940
Ndiyo, nitahifadhi.

396
00:25:52,963 --> 00:25:56,796
Basi, tutapumzika kidogo?

397
00:25:56,819 --> 00:26:00,753
Ndiyo, twende kununua kahawa.

398
00:26:00,776 --> 00:26:04,746
Mimi nataka kokoa tamu.

399
00:26:04,769 --> 00:26:08,269
Basi, mimi nitanunua.

400
00:26:08,292 --> 00:26:10,859
Eh, unaweza?

401
00:26:10,882 --> 00:26:12,748
Asante.

402
00:26:12,771 --> 00:26:17,538
Kila wakati unanifundisha, ni kawaida nifanye hivi.

403
00:26:17,561 --> 00:26:21,028
Basi, nitakubali kwa shukrani.

404
00:26:21,051 --> 00:26:24,284
Subiri kidogo, tafadhali.

405
00:26:24,307 --> 00:26:28,045
Baridi kali Japani wakati wa majira ya baridi.

406
00:26:28,068 --> 00:26:33,801
Lakini upendo wa marafiki unanifanya niwe na moyo wa joto.

407
00:26:33,824 --> 00:26:38,537
Baada ya mtihani, nataka twende kucheza pamoja.

408
00:26:38,561 --> 00:26:40,061
Sehemu ya 9: Kwenye tamasha la kitamaduni cha chuo kikuu - Duka la Okonomiyaki

409
00:26:40,061 --> 00:26:45,961
Wikendi hii ni tamasha la kitamaduni cha chuo kikuu.

410
00:26:45,984 --> 00:26:51,503
Darasa letu litaendesha duka la okonomiyaki.

411
00:26:51,527 --> 00:26:56,960
Okonomiyaki ni kama pizza ya Kijapani.

412
00:26:56,983 --> 00:27:02,460
Napenda sana chakula hiki.

413
00:27:02,484 --> 00:27:06,671
Tutakataza darasa pamoja.

414
00:27:06,694 --> 00:27:11,760
Tutakatakata kadobodi na kuchora picha.

415
00:27:11,783 --> 00:27:17,059
Tamasha kama hili halikuwepo nchini kwangu.

416
00:27:17,083 --> 00:27:21,652
Rangi ya bango, hii ni nzuri?

417
00:27:21,675 --> 00:27:24,775
Nzuri sana.

418
00:27:24,798 --> 00:27:27,698
Inaonekana vizuri.

419
00:27:27,721 --> 00:27:29,621
Asante.

420
00:27:29,645 --> 00:27:33,355
Una uwezo mkubwa wa kuchora.

421
00:27:33,378 --> 00:27:37,812
Tangu zamani nilipenda kuchora.

422
00:27:37,835 --> 00:27:42,701
Huu mhusika ni mzuri sana.

423
00:27:42,724 --> 00:27:45,480
Kweli?

424
00:27:45,504 --> 00:27:48,378
Nafurahi sana.

425
00:27:48,402 --> 00:27:52,239
Umejifunza kupika okonomiyaki?

426
00:27:52,263 --> 00:27:54,496
Ndiyo.

427
00:27:54,519 --> 00:27:58,474
Jana nilijifunza nyumbani.

428
00:27:58,498 --> 00:28:01,831
Uliweza kulitumbukiza vizuri?

429
00:28:01,854 --> 00:28:05,554
Mara ya kwanza nilishindwa.

430
00:28:05,577 --> 00:28:08,644
Ina umuhimu, sivyo?

431
00:28:08,667 --> 00:28:12,810
Lakini mara ya pili ulikuwa mkamilifu.

432
00:28:12,833 --> 00:28:15,405
Unaweza kabisa!

433
00:28:15,428 --> 00:28:18,062
Tunaitegemea hata wakati wa maonyesho.

434
00:28:18,085 --> 00:28:20,189
Ndiyo.

435
00:28:20,212 --> 00:28:23,045
Tutawapeka kwa wingi.

436
00:28:23,068 --> 00:28:26,974
Unaweza kunisaidia kukata kabichi pia?

437
00:28:26,997 --> 00:28:29,112
Ndiyo.

438
00:28:29,136 --> 00:28:31,836
Nitakubali kwa furaha.

439
00:28:31,859 --> 00:28:37,046
Harufu ya mchuzi inanifanya nijisikie njaa.

440
00:28:37,070 --> 00:28:39,020
Ndiyo.

441
00:28:39,044 --> 00:28:41,910
Natumaini tupate kula mapema.

442
00:28:41,933 --> 00:28:45,567
Kesho tutakuwa na shughuli nyingi.

443
00:28:45,590 --> 00:28:50,323
Tungewapenda wateja wengi watufike.

444
00:28:50,346 --> 00:28:53,820
Hakika watakuja wengi.

445
00:28:53,844 --> 00:28:56,877
Tutafanya nini ikiwa tutauza vyote?

446
00:28:56,900 --> 00:29:01,133
Wakati huo, tutashangilia pamoja.

447
00:29:01,156 --> 00:29:04,056
Tufanye iwe mafanikio makubwa.

448
00:29:04,079 --> 00:29:08,858
Baada ya kuandaa kila kitu, twende pamoja kula chakula.

449
00:29:08,881 --> 00:29:11,415
Nzuri sana.

450
00:29:11,438 --> 00:29:13,938
Twende basi.

451
00:29:13,961 --> 00:29:18,894
Maandalizi ya tamasha la kitamaduni yananifanya nijisikie furaha kubwa.

452
00:29:18,917 --> 00:29:24,428
Wanafunzi wote wa darasa wanajitahidi kwa lengo moja.

453
00:29:24,451 --> 00:29:29,157
Napenda hisia hii ya umoja.

454
00:29:29,181 --> 00:29:30,681
Sehemu ya 10: Kumbukumbu za Tamasha la Kitamaduni

455
00:29:30,681 --> 00:29:34,114
Tamasha la kitamaduni limekwisha.

456
00:29:34,137 --> 00:29:38,970
Duka letu limefanikiwa sana.

457
00:29:38,994 --> 00:29:43,584
Okonomiyaki yote imeuza.

458
00:29:43,608 --> 00:29:49,574
Chuo kina utulivu sana baada ya kusafisha.

459
00:29:49,597 --> 00:29:55,131
Baada ya sherehe, hisia kidogo za upweke zinaniuma.

460
00:29:55,154 --> 00:30:01,705
Lakini kumbukumbu za furaha zitabaki moyoni mwangu milele.

461
00:30:01,728 --> 00:30:04,261
Umechoka?

462
00:30:04,284 --> 00:30:09,384
Aa, Sakura. Umechoka sana leo.

463
00:30:09,407 --> 00:30:12,960
Tamasha la kitamaduni lilikuwa la ajabu, sivyo?

464
00:30:12,984 --> 00:30:17,084
Ndiyo. Siku nzuri kabisa.

465
00:30:17,107 --> 00:30:21,015
Asante kwa kuoka kwa muda mrefu.

466
00:30:21,039 --> 00:30:25,772
La, nilifurahia sana.

467
00:30:25,795 --> 00:30:30,228
Wateja walisema ilikuwa ladha nzuri.

468
00:30:30,251 --> 00:30:34,918
Kusikia hivyo, ninafurahi sana.

469
00:30:34,941 --> 00:30:38,925
Wanafunzi wenzangu pia walifurahi.

470
00:30:38,948 --> 00:30:41,943
Kweli ilikuwa nzuri.

471
00:30:41,967 --> 00:30:45,067
Nimechoka kidogo.

472
00:30:45,090 --> 00:30:49,356
Ndiyo, miguu inaniuma.

473
00:30:49,379 --> 00:30:52,279
Pumzika polepole.

474
00:30:52,302 --> 00:30:56,436
Sakura pia, pumzika polepole.

475
00:30:56,459 --> 00:30:59,592
Utafanya nini baadaye?

476
00:30:59,615 --> 00:31:03,082
Nitakwenda na marafiki kwa ajili ya sherehe ya mwisho.

477
00:31:03,104 --> 00:31:06,838
Aa, nitakwenda pia.

478
00:31:06,861 --> 00:31:09,407
Je, ni duka lilelile?

479
00:31:09,430 --> 00:31:12,730
Ni mkahawa karibu na kituo cha treni.

480
00:31:12,753 --> 00:31:16,087
Aa, ni pale pale.

481
00:31:16,110 --> 00:31:19,585
Basi, twende pamoja.

482
00:31:19,608 --> 00:31:23,541
Ndiyo, twende kwa miguu.

483
00:31:23,564 --> 00:31:27,156
Leo tutakula kwa wingi.

484
00:31:27,180 --> 00:31:31,313
Ndiyo, tutakunywa kwa wingi.

485
00:31:31,336 --> 00:31:35,203
Nilifurahia sana leo.

486
00:31:35,226 --> 00:31:37,897
Mimi pia.

487
00:31:37,920 --> 00:31:41,153
Kumbukumbu isiyoweza kusahaulika.

488
00:31:41,176 --> 00:31:44,758
Tutaonana kesho shuleni.

489
00:31:44,782 --> 00:31:48,449
Ndiyo, tutaonana kesho.

490
00:31:48,472 --> 00:31:53,306
Mwezi mzuri unaonekana usiku wa leo.

491
00:31:53,330 --> 00:31:57,996
Mwezi huo huo ninauona kutoka nchi yangu.

492
00:31:58,019 --> 00:32:04,553
Ninaishi kwa furaha na wakati usiobadilika katika nchi hii.

493
00:32:04,576 --> 00:32:10,117
Kesho pia itakuwa siku nzuri bila shaka.